1784345329.478 RX Magic Shoppe
1784345329.478 RX     It is immediately obvious what this dwelling is as soon as you walk in. The
1784345329.478 RX room is nearly filled with arcane items and talismans of all sorts, and such
1784345329.478 RX esoteric things as Griffin claws and vials of Dragon's blood. As you turn your
1784345329.478 RX eyes towards the back of the room, you see a bored-looking young man sitting
1784345329.478 RX behind a counter. A large rack of rolled parchment scrolls sits behind his
1784345329.478 RX head. A shimmering bead curtain blocks your sight to the east, and there is a
1784345329.478 RX door north. 
1784345329.501 RX Also here: Aiken.
1784345329.502 RX Obvious exits: north, east
1784345329.502 RX [HP=51/MA=54]:e
1784345330.719 RX Magic Shoppe, Back Room
1784345330.719 RX     The first thing that you notice as you enter this room is a striking
1784345330.719 RX middle-aged woman, wearing deep purple robes embroidered with silver runes. As
1784345330.719 RX you take a closer look, you can see pointed ears protruding from her long
1784345330.719 RX silvery hair -- she is an Elf! As you approach, she nods and gestures for you
1784345330.719 RX to sit down, saying "Welcome, adventurers. Do ye need training in the magical
1784345330.719 RX arts?" 
1784345330.719 RX Obvious exits: west
