1784345464.202 RX The Silver River, Silvermere Docks
1784345464.203 RX     The rapid currents of the river make it perilous to travel, even in a
1784345464.203 RX suitable vessel, as it is filled with strange water-dwellers. The shimmering
1784345464.203 RX silvery surface of the water gives the river its namesake. To the north, you
1784345464.203 RX can see the gravelly beach of a large island poking out of the middle of the
1784345464.203 RX river, and to the south, the seldom-used port of Silvermere. The river flows
1784345464.203 RX quickly downstream to the west, and upstream to the east. 
