1784345623.520 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784345623.520 RX from tall posts, and continues to the north and south. Directly to the east you
1784345623.520 RX can see a pub, and judgeing from its appearance it caters to the working class.
