1784345654.245 RX Guild Street
1784345654.247 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784345654.247 RX from tall posts, and continues to the north and south. There is a steady stream
1784345654.247 RX of people here, mostly heading north towards the Adventurer's Guild. The Guild
1784345654.247 RX is prospering in these rough times, as they train adventurers and support their
1784345654.247 RX ventures into the overrun slums. You can see the enormous building dominating
1784345654.247 RX the east side of the street. To the west a sign saying "Colin's Maces" hangs on
