1784345656.537 RX Guild Street, Southern End
1784345656.539 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784345656.539 RX from tall posts, and continues to the north and south. The street here is well
1784345656.539 RX traveled, and you see quite a few people heading towards and away from the town
1784345656.539 RX square to the south. The reason for the heavy traffic is the Adventurer's
1784345656.539 RX Guild, far off to the north. The din from the town square is quite loud here.
1784345656.539 RX There are shops to the east and west. 
1784345656.586 RX Also here: fat black cat, big filthy beggar.
