1784345659.745 RX     The crowd is quite dense here, as the town square is to the east,
1784345659.745 RX attracting people with its produce and items. A massive stone building is to
1784345659.745 RX the north, and you can hear the sound of ringing coming from within its open
1784345659.745 RX door. A sign with and anvil and the words "Skali's Armour" hangs over the door.
1784345659.745 RX To the south, the thick doors of the city bank stand wedged open. Guards stand
1784345659.745 RX at the entrance, with halberd and mail, ever vigilant. Temple street leads off
1784345659.745 RX to the west here. 
1784345659.772 RX Also here: elite guardsman, guardsman, fat guardsman.
1784345659.773 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
1784345659.773 RX [HP=26/MA=66]:w
