1784345663.728 RX Temple Street
1784345663.729 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784345663.729 RX from tall posts. There a quite a few people here, many of them robed in white
1784345663.729 RX cowled robes. You cannot help but notice the huge, garishly-painted building to
1784345663.729 RX the south. An immense, painted sign glimmers and magically flashes the words
1784345663.729 RX "Lucky Strike Casino". Its large golden doors are closed, and a sign says "New
1784345663.729 RX Grand Reopening!" and under that a nicer sign says "Open by order of Silvermere
1784345663.729 RX Council" 
