1784345665.145 RX Temple Street
1784345665.145 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784345665.145 RX from tall posts, and continues to the east and west. Off to the west, you can
1784345665.145 RX see the shining shape of the Temple. Even from afar it seems to radiate peace
1784345665.145 RX and hope. To the north, a fresh stone wall has been built, blocking access to
1784345665.145 RX what once lay beyond, and Temple Street continues to the east and west. 
1784345665.145 RX Obvious exits: east, west
1784345665.145 RX [HP=26/MA=66]:w
1784345666.752 RX Intersection of Temple St. & Stone St.
1784345666.753 RX     The magnificent Temple of Silvermere stands tall and proud to your west. It
1784345666.753 RX white silver-streaked marble walls are a testament to its magnificent
1784345666.753 RX construction, as does the fact that it has remained seemingly undamaged for the
1784345666.753 RX past hundred years. This is where weary folk go to have their wounds healed,
1784345666.753 RX and where holy folk receive their divine training. The Temple's large wrought
1784345666.753 RX doors are open to the public at all hours. Stone street crosses to the north
1784345666.753 RX and south here. 
1784345666.753 RX Also here: elite guardsman.
1784345666.753 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
1784345666.753 RX [HP=26/MA=66]:w
1784345668.156 RX Temple Foyer
1784345668.157 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784345668.157 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784345668.157 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. Racks and shelves line the
1784345668.157 RX walls, for people to leave dirty cloaks or clothing. To the east are the
1784345668.157 RX Temple's ornate doors, propped open even in these uncertain times, and to the
1784345668.157 RX west, a wide passageway leads towards the inner parts of the Temple. 
1784345668.157 RX Obvious exits: east, west
1784345668.157 RX [HP=26/MA=66]:w
1784345669.867 RX Temple Hall
1784345669.868 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784345669.868 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784345669.868 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. A wide passageway to the
1784345669.868 RX east leads to the Temple's foyer, and from there out onto the street. To the
1784345669.868 RX south, you can see the Priest spell shop, and to the north, the Temple's
1784345669.868 RX Healer. The large hall continues to the west, at the end of which is the
1784345669.868 RX chapel. 
1784345669.868 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
1784345669.868 RX [HP=26/MA=66]:n
1784345672.756 RX Temple Healer
1784345672.757 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784345672.757 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. There is a
1784345672.757 RX priest waiting here to heal the wounded. She smiles kindly at you as you enter.
1784345672.757 RX A small bowl of silver nobles stands on the table she sits behind, and you can
1784345672.757 RX see it is nearly full. A stone stairwell descends into the catacombs of the
1784345672.757 RX temple at the rear of this room, and you can exit into the main hall to the
1784345672.757 RX south. 
1784345672.757 RX You notice small sign here.
1784345672.757 RX Also here: wounded messenger, healer.
1784345672.757 RX Obvious exits: south, down
