1784345756.352 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784345756.352 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. A wide passageway to the
1784345756.352 RX east leads to the Temple's foyer, and from there out onto the street. To the
1784345756.352 RX south, you can see the Priest spell shop, and to the north, the Temple's
1784345756.352 RX Healer. The large hall continues to the west, at the end of which is the
1784345756.352 RX chapel. 
