1784346219.659 RX Temple Healer
1784346219.660 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784346219.660 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. There is a
1784346219.660 RX priest waiting here to heal the wounded. She smiles kindly at you as you enter.
1784346219.660 RX A small bowl of silver nobles stands on the table she sits behind, and you can
1784346219.660 RX see it is nearly full. A stone stairwell descends into the catacombs of the
1784346219.660 RX temple at the rear of this room, and you can exit into the main hall to the
1784346219.660 RX south. 
1784346219.660 RX You notice small sign here.
1784346219.660 RX Also here: wounded messenger, healer.
1784346219.660 RX Obvious exits: south, down
