1784346249.017 RX Temple Hall
1784346249.017 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784346249.017 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784346249.017 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. A wide passageway to the
1784346249.017 RX east leads to the Temple's foyer, and from there out onto the street. To the
1784346249.017 RX south, you can see the Priest spell shop, and to the north, the Temple's
1784346249.017 RX Healer. The large hall continues to the west, at the end of which is the
1784346249.017 RX chapel. 
1784346249.017 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
