1784346252.561 RX Intersection of Temple St. & Stone St.
1784346252.564 RX     The magnificent Temple of Silvermere stands tall and proud to your west. It
1784346252.564 RX white silver-streaked marble walls are a testament to its magnificent
1784346252.564 RX construction, as does the fact that it has remained seemingly undamaged for the
1784346252.564 RX past hundred years. This is where weary folk go to have their wounds healed,
1784346252.564 RX and where holy folk receive their divine training. The Temple's large wrought
1784346252.564 RX doors are open to the public at all hours. Stone street crosses to the north
1784346252.564 RX and south here. 
1784346252.564 RX Also here: nasty elite guardsman.
1784346252.564 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
