1784346383.502 RX door. A sign with and anvil and the words "Skali's Armour" hangs over the door.
1784346383.502 RX To the south, the thick doors of the city bank stand wedged open. Guards stand
1784346383.502 RX at the entrance, with halberd and mail, ever vigilant. Temple street leads off
