1784346917.579 RX Temple Street, Eastern End
1784346917.582 RX     The crowd is quite dense here, as the town square is to the east,
1784346917.582 RX attracting people with its produce and items. A massive stone building is to
1784346917.582 RX the north, and you can hear the sound of ringing coming from within its open
1784346917.582 RX door. A sign with and anvil and the words "Skali's Armour" hangs over the door.
1784346917.582 RX To the south, the thick doors of the city bank stand wedged open. Guards stand
1784346917.582 RX at the entrance, with halberd and mail, ever vigilant. Temple street leads off
1784346917.582 RX to the west here. 
1784346917.582 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
