1784346924.898 RX Temple Foyer
1784346924.901 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784346924.901 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784346924.901 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. Racks and shelves line the
1784346924.901 RX walls, for people to leave dirty cloaks or clothing. To the east are the
1784346924.901 RX Temple's ornate doors, propped open even in these uncertain times, and to the
1784346924.901 RX west, a wide passageway leads towards the inner parts of the Temple. 
1784346924.901 RX Obvious exits: east, west
