1784347078.052 RX Limestone Tunnel, Cave Mouth
1784347078.055 RX     This smooth-walled tunnel is cut directly into the stone here, its even
1784347078.055 RX surface obviously the work of something other than nature's gentle hand. The
1784347078.055 RX tunnel is perfectly round, with the bottom quarter of the tube cut off to make
1784347078.055 RX a flat and level floor. To the north, it slopes down into the darkness at a
1784347078.055 RX steep angle, and you can exit into the sunlight through a large opening to the
1784347078.055 RX south. 
1784347078.055 RX You notice 1964 gold crowns, 7 silver nobles, 2 copper farthings here.
1784347078.055 RX Also here: stone golem.
1784347078.055 RX Obvious exits: north, south
1784347078.055 RX The room is dimly lit
