1784348417.728 RX 
1784348417.730 RX Temple, Halls of the Dead
1784348417.731 RX     This somber stone chamber is barely illuminated by the many torches lining
1784348417.731 RX its walls, and it seems to stretch on forever. Many marble slabs lay in neatly
1784348417.731 RX ordered rows about the room, some of them bearing sheet-shrouded forms upon
1784348417.731 RX them. White clad priests solemnly stride throughout the hall, making
1784348417.731 RX preparations for burial of the dead. The only sound is the faint shuffling of
1784348417.731 RX the priests, and the occasional closing of a door. A stone staircase set in the
1784348417.731 RX east wall leads up. 
1784348417.731 RX Obvious exits: up
1784348417.731 PART [HP=56/MA=66]:
1784348427.503 RX You hear movement above you!
1784348427.525 RX [HP=56/MA=66]:You hear movement above you!
1784348427.525 PART [HP=56/MA=66]:
1784348429.517 TX u
1784348429.518 RX u
1784348430.439 RX Temple Healer
1784348430.439 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784348430.439 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. There is a
1784348430.439 RX priest waiting here to heal the wounded. She smiles kindly at you as you enter.
1784348430.439 RX A small bowl of silver nobles stands on the table she sits behind, and you can
1784348430.439 RX see it is nearly full. A stone stairwell descends into the catacombs of the
1784348430.439 RX temple at the rear of this room, and you can exit into the main hall to the
1784348430.439 RX south. 
1784348430.439 RX You notice small sign here.
