1784348431.447 RX Temple Hall
1784348431.447 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784348431.447 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784348431.447 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. A wide passageway to the
1784348431.447 RX east leads to the Temple's foyer, and from there out onto the street. To the
1784348431.447 RX south, you can see the Priest spell shop, and to the north, the Temple's
1784348431.447 RX Healer. The large hall continues to the west, at the end of which is the
1784348431.447 RX chapel. 
1784348431.448 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
