1784348433.985 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. Racks and shelves line the
1784348433.985 RX walls, for people to leave dirty cloaks or clothing. To the east are the
1784348433.985 RX Temple's ornate doors, propped open even in these uncertain times, and to the
1784348433.985 RX west, a wide passageway leads towards the inner parts of the Temple. 
