1784348435.604 RX Intersection of Temple St. & Stone St.
1784348435.605 RX     The magnificent Temple of Silvermere stands tall and proud to your west. It
1784348435.605 RX white silver-streaked marble walls are a testament to its magnificent
1784348435.605 RX construction, as does the fact that it has remained seemingly undamaged for the
1784348435.605 RX past hundred years. This is where weary folk go to have their wounds healed,
1784348435.605 RX and where holy folk receive their divine training. The Temple's large wrought
1784348435.605 RX doors are open to the public at all hours. Stone street crosses to the north
1784348435.605 RX and south here. 
