1784348754.335 RX Temple Healer
1784348754.335 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784348754.335 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. There is a
1784348754.335 RX priest waiting here to heal the wounded. She smiles kindly at you as you enter.
1784348754.335 RX A small bowl of silver nobles stands on the table she sits behind, and you can
1784348754.335 RX see it is nearly full. A stone stairwell descends into the catacombs of the
1784348754.335 RX temple at the rear of this room, and you can exit into the main hall to the
1784348754.335 RX south. 
1784348754.335 RX You notice small sign here.
1784348754.335 RX Also here: wounded messenger, healer.
1784348754.335 RX Obvious exits: south, down
