1784348757.155 RX Temple Foyer
1784348757.163 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784348757.163 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. Bright lamps
1784348757.163 RX line the walls, illuminating every dark corner here. Racks and shelves line the
1784348757.163 RX walls, for people to leave dirty cloaks or clothing. To the east are the
1784348757.163 RX Temple's ornate doors, propped open even in these uncertain times, and to the
1784348757.163 RX west, a wide passageway leads towards the inner parts of the Temple. 
1784348757.163 RX Obvious exits: east, west
