1784348773.655 RX Intersection of Stone St. & Noble St.
1784348773.655 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784348773.655 RX from tall posts. The city wall is to the south, towering over twenty feet above
1784348773.655 RX you. It is quiet and deserted here, due to the proximity of the slums. Debris
1784348773.655 RX and garbage is piled up against the walls, and here and there you can see a
1784348773.655 RX stray animal cowering in the shadows. Stone street arrows off to the north, and
1784348773.655 RX Noble street is to the east and west. 
1784348773.655 RX Obvious exits: north, east, west
