1784348777.137 RX Noble Street, Slum Gates
1784348777.137 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784348777.137 RX from tall posts. Debris and garbage is thick here, as the slum gates lie to
1784348777.137 RX your south. Just inside these gates you can see the fortified position of a
1784348777.137 RX makeshift guard post. The street continues to the east and west. 
1784348777.137 RX Also here: big filthy beggar, big filthy beggar.
1784348777.137 RX Obvious exits: south, east, west
