1784348779.033 RX Slum Entrance
1784348779.048 RX     The narrow path is barricaded heavily by a makeshift construction of heavy
1784348779.048 RX wooden beams. Guards flank the only opening in this wall, keeping a watchful
1784348779.048 RX eye on all who approach. It is well-known that the slums have recently been
1784348779.048 RX overrun by gangs and thugs, and that the need to keep these destructive
1784348779.048 RX elements away from the city proper is great. You can exit through the barricade
1784348779.048 RX to the south, or onto a street to the north. 
1784348779.048 RX Also here: guardsman, large guardsman.
1784348779.048 RX Obvious exits: north, south
1784348779.048 RX [HP=56/MA=65]:s
1784348780.050 RX Slum Street
1784348780.051 RX     This is a dirty, unkept street. Debris and refuse is shoved into piles up
1784348780.051 RX against the sides on tall, rickety buildings here, and a gutter in the middle
1784348780.051 RX of the sloped street guides a stream of filthy water. The stone tiles are
1784348780.051 RX cracked in many places, showing rocky bits of ground. There is a barricade off
1784348780.051 RX to the north, and you can continue down the street to the south. 
1784348780.051 RX Obvious exits: north, south
