1784349651.704 RX esoteric things as Griffin claws and vials of Dragon's blood. As you turn your
1784349651.704 RX eyes towards the back of the room, you see a bored-looking young man sitting
1784349651.704 RX behind a counter. A large rack of rolled parchment scrolls sits behind his
1784349651.704 RX head. A shimmering bead curtain blocks your sight to the east, and there is a
1784349651.704 RX door north. 
