1784349796.343 RX [HP=33/MA=66]:Town Square
1784349796.343 RX     As can be seen from the masses of townsfolk gathered around the make- shift
1784349796.343 RX stalls and shops here, this is the centre of Silvermere. Despite the recent
1784349796.343 RX increase in highway ambushes, fresh vegetables and meats are still brought in
1784349796.343 RX by brave farmers, and these are on prominent display. You can see a great many
1784349796.343 RX trinkets for sale as well, such as intricate wooden puppets, to bolts of
1784349796.343 RX beautiful cloth. Streets lead off in all directions, and a manhole can be seen
1784349796.343 RX under some debris. 
1784349796.343 RX You notice small sign, large sign here.
1784349796.400 RX Also here: Templar, large guardsman, elite guardsman.
1784349796.400 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
