1784349982.935 RX Grassy Cove
1784349982.935 RX     This small hollow in the rock is carpeted with a soft, wavy-bladed blue
1784349982.935 RX grass. The sheer walls of the cliff rise up imperiously about you, and you
1784349982.935 RX realize that you are walking in an open-roofed fissure splitting some immense
1784349982.935 RX stone. The fissure winds its way off to the north, and to the south a large
1784349982.935 RX crack can be seen in the rock face. A small hole, partially concealed by the
1784349982.935 RX shape of the rock, is bored into the base of the wall to the east. 
