1784349988.959 RX tunnel is perfectly round, with the bottom quarter of the tube cut off to make
1784349988.959 RX a flat and level floor. To the north, it slopes down into the darkness at a
1784349988.959 RX steep angle, and you can exit into the sunlight through a large opening to the
