1784350401.395 RX Grassy Cove, Cave Entrance
1784350401.399 RX     This small hollow in the rock is carpeted with a soft, wavy-bladed blue
1784350401.399 RX grass. The sheer walls of the cliff rise up imperiously about you, and you
1784350401.399 RX realize that you are walking in an open-roofed fissure splitting some immense
1784350401.399 RX stone. To the north, a massive cave mouth yawns forebodingly at you, its black
1784350401.399 RX depths barely illuminated from the light above. The path through the grass
1784350401.399 RX leading inside appears to have not been used in some while. The fissure
1784350401.399 RX continues to the southeast. 
1784350401.399 RX Obvious exits: north, southeast
1784350401.399 RX [HP=2/MA=66]:se
