1784350418.250 RX Beach's End
1784350418.254 RX     This is a gravelly beach, curving around the sheer rock face to the north.
1784350418.254 RX Bits of shell and bone litter the beach, and if there is any plant life, you
1784350418.254 RX certainly cannot find it. In fact, there is a noticeable lack of life signs
1784350418.254 RX throughout this whole area, and you get the feeling that even the animals that
1784350418.254 RX may have inhabited this island have abandoned it. The rock face cuts off the
1784350418.254 RX beach here, but you spy a small path leading through a large crack. 
