1784350729.551 RX Gravelly Beach
1784350729.551 RX     This is a gravelly beach, curving around the sheer rock face to the north.
1784350729.551 RX Bits of shell and bone litter the beach, and if there is any plant life, you
1784350729.551 RX certainly cannot find it. In fact, there is a noticeable lack of life signs
1784350729.551 RX throughout this whole area, and you get the feeling that even the animals that
1784350729.551 RX may have inhabited this island have abandoned it. The beach continues to the
1784350729.551 RX northeast and southwest. 
1784350729.551 RX Obvious exits: northeast, southwest
1784350729.552 RX [HP=56/MA=26]:ne
