1784350734.492 RX Grassy Cove
1784350734.493 RX     This small hollow in the rock is carpeted with a soft, wavy-bladed blue
1784350734.493 RX grass. The sheer walls of the cliff rise up imperiously about you, and you
1784350734.493 RX realize that you are walking in an open-roofed fissure splitting some immense
1784350734.493 RX stone. The fissure winds its way off to the north, and to the south a large
1784350734.493 RX crack can be seen in the rock face. A small hole, partially concealed by the
1784350734.493 RX shape of the rock, is bored into the base of the wall to the east. 
1784350734.493 RX Obvious exits: north
