1784350741.819 RX Limestone Tunnel, Cave Mouth
1784350741.819 RX     This smooth-walled tunnel is cut directly into the stone here, its even
1784350741.819 RX surface obviously the work of something other than nature's gentle hand. The
1784350741.819 RX tunnel is perfectly round, with the bottom quarter of the tube cut off to make
1784350741.819 RX a flat and level floor. To the north, it slopes down into the darkness at a
1784350741.819 RX steep angle, and you can exit into the sunlight through a large opening to the
1784350741.819 RX south. 
