1784351152.353 RX Island, Beach Landing
1784351152.353 RX     This is a gravelly beach bordering a small, sheltered lagoon. Off across
1784351152.353 RX the raging river, you can see the port-side of the city of Silvermere. The
1784351152.353 RX beach continues off to the east and west, curving around the sheer rock face
1784351152.353 RX which towers above you. 
1784351152.353 RX Obvious exits: south, east, west
