1784351157.462 RX The river bashes you up against some rocks!
1784351157.467 RX Pier, Boat Launch
1784351157.468 RX     This is a small, haphazardly constructed wooden pier, supported by rotting
1784351157.468 RX pillars over the swift waters of the river. Tied to the end are a half-dozen
1784351157.468 RX skiffs of varying size. To the north, the Silver river's glittering length runs
1784351157.468 RX perilously fast. 
1784351157.468 RX Obvious exits: north, south
1784351157.468 RX [HP=39/MA=50]:s
