1784351164.353 RX Docks
1784351164.354 RX     This is a cobblestoned street. It is dimly lit by guttering lanterns hung
1784351164.354 RX from tall posts. To the west you can see Wharf street, and to the east there is
1784351164.354 RX a small, run-down shack. From the look of it, it looks to be a caretaker's
1784351164.354 RX house of some sort. River street runs parallel to Wharf street to the south.
1784351164.354 RX Off to the north, a rickety boat launch juts out into the fast-flowing waters
1784351164.354 RX of the Silver river. 
1784351164.354 RX Obvious exits: north, south, east, west
