1784351880.807 RX Temple, Halls of the Dead
1784351880.807 RX     This somber stone chamber is barely illuminated by the many torches lining
1784351880.807 RX its walls, and it seems to stretch on forever. Many marble slabs lay in neatly
1784351880.807 RX ordered rows about the room, some of them bearing sheet-shrouded forms upon
1784351880.807 RX them. White clad priests solemnly stride throughout the hall, making
1784351880.807 RX preparations for burial of the dead. The only sound is the faint shuffling of
1784351880.807 RX the priests, and the occasional closing of a door. A stone staircase set in the
1784351880.807 RX east wall leads up. 
1784351880.808 RX Obvious exits: up
