1784352343.020 RX Temple Healer
1784352343.020 RX     The hall's lofty roof is supported by graceful soaring archways, and the
1784352343.020 RX walls are crafted of white marble run through with silver streaks. There is a
1784352343.020 RX priest waiting here to heal the wounded. She smiles kindly at you as you enter.
1784352343.020 RX A small bowl of silver nobles stands on the table she sits behind, and you can
1784352343.020 RX see it is nearly full. A stone stairwell descends into the catacombs of the
